{
  "nl": "物料管理：表格上方左侧是“批量导出”按钮，右侧是“新增物料”按钮；表格展示物料编码、物料名称、库存数量；行内有编辑、删除；新增和编辑弹窗里填写物料编码、物料名称、库存数量。",
  "nlEn": "Material management: above the table, the \"Batch Export\" button is on the left and the \"Add Material\" button is on the right; the table shows material code, material name, and stock quantity; each row has edit and delete; the add and edit dialogs contain material code, material name, and stock quantity.",
  "fixedFields": ["materialCode", "materialName", "stock"],
  "pinnedDims": ["propSet", "actions", "tableBtns", "operationColumn", "dialogs"],
  "config": {
    "name": "MaterialManage",
    "apiUrl": "/api/materials",
    "fields": [
      { "prop": "materialCode", "label": "物料编码", "formtype": "Input" },
      { "prop": "materialName", "label": "物料名称", "formtype": "Input" },
      { "prop": "stock", "label": "库存数量", "formtype": "InputNumber", "inQuery": false }
    ],
    "actions": ["add", "edit", "delete"],
    "tableBtns": [
      { "name": "批量导出", "position": "left", "actionType": "export" },
      { "name": "新增物料", "type": "primary", "position": "right", "dialogKey": "add" }
    ],
    "operationColumn": {
      "label": "操作",
      "btns": [
        { "name": "编辑", "dialogKey": "edit" },
        { "name": "删除", "confirm": "确定删除该物料吗？" }
      ]
    },
    "dialogs": {
      "add": {
        "title": "新增物料",
        "formItems": [
          { "prop": "materialCode", "label": "物料编码", "formtype": "Input" },
          { "prop": "materialName", "label": "物料名称", "formtype": "Input" },
          { "prop": "stock", "label": "库存数量", "formtype": "InputNumber" }
        ]
      },
      "edit": {
        "title": "编辑物料",
        "formItems": [
          { "prop": "materialCode", "label": "物料编码", "formtype": "Input" },
          { "prop": "materialName", "label": "物料名称", "formtype": "Input" },
          { "prop": "stock", "label": "库存数量", "formtype": "InputNumber" }
        ]
      }
    }
  },
  "notes": "AN-07 左/右：tableBtns 同时使用推荐字段 position:'left'/'right'，且一个按钮走 actionType（导出）、一个走 dialogKey（打开新增弹窗）。评分口径 name|归一化 code|actionType 必须与渲染器落位一致 —— 若 position 被 strip 或 dialogKey 被丢，按钮会跑边或点不开弹窗。"
}
